//--Keywords--//

CODE ~ The header of a ENGO class
Ex: CODE <name of class>.

TASK ~ Declares a method
Ex: (Basic) TASK <name of method>.
Ex: (With Args) TASK <name of method> NEED (<type> <name of variable>, ...).
Ex: (With Return) TASK <name of method> GIVE <type>.

